{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"他提醒自己不能倒下，心里却很想停下来\",\"source\":\"也可以把它听成一个人强迫自己挺直背脊，提醒自己不能倒下；可自由琶音马上把这份郑重带回内心的游移。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把它作为音乐引发的拟人化听感，屏幕稿却直接写成“他”在提醒自己，容易被理解为人物实际产生了这个念头。\"},{\"sec\":\"S02\",\"screen\":\"也像在说：“我不甘心就这样消沉下去”\",\"source\":\"另一种心理动因是，44–65小节的激昂像一句“我不甘心就这样消亡”：不是轻松恢复自信，而是负隅顽抗。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"“消亡”表达的是不甘心就此消失、消亡，改成“消沉下去”则变成不甘心陷入低落，改变了抗拒所针对的东西。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"那件事明明重要，他却没力气再讲一遍\",\"source\":\"这些轻弱、零碎的声音，也像一个疲倦的人在回想一件往事：明明知道它很重要，却已经没有力气把它重新讲述一遍。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿只是把音乐比作一个疲倦的人回想往事，屏幕稿去掉了比喻关系，变成他确实有一件重要往事且无力复述。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"想起好时候仍会心软，也怕往后一个人熬（第13秒出现）\",\"source\":\"想起那些好时候，他还是会心软，也怕往后一个人熬，可他不再怪自己当初离开，更不愿只为有人陪着就回头；他愿意带着想念继续过日子。\",\"type\":\"7\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿先写心软和害怕独自熬下去，再写不自责、不回头和继续生活；屏幕稿把前面的感受放到了这些选择之后，改变了呈现顺序。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ec57cc7a-0a99-457d-81c9-cbd36c8e8971", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T215455300788Z", "elapsed_seconds": 402.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:01:37.297521+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9456bd94a9b167b28a772799cf8db8bd7cd458d0b677c526a42ad75577ea0a37", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T215455300788Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "cdb3132e5bcb4f3698c6b341799481091d4c6a6aa4994d5c01d850e2f72a2165"}}}
